OL,3,GNEWSAWho are the candidates in the
OL,4,AHolborn and St Pancras by-election?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCandidates are being announced to stand
OL,7,Fin the Holborn and St Pancras
OL,8,Fby-election, which is set to take place
OL,9,Fon 8 October.
OL,11,FThe seat became vacant after former
OL,12,Fprime minister Sir Keir Starmer
OL,13,Fannounced he was standing down to focus
OL,14,Fon a role in international affairs.
OL,16,FHere are the people who have so far
OL,17,Fannounced they are standing to become
OL,18,Fthe area's next MP, listed in
OL,19,Falphabetical order.
OL,21,FNominations close on Tuesday 15
OL,22,FSeptember at 16:00 BST.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
